msgid "Select a folder to save the settings in.\n"
"This could be in a temporary location\n"
"from where just the needed settings\n"
"can be accessed and copied into the\n"
"appropriate place of an existing config."
msgstr "选择要保存设置的文件夹。\n"
"这可以是一个临时位置\n"
"，从这里只需访问所需的设置\n"
