#: temp.glade:12645
msgid "Only relevant where there is both a background image\n"
"*and* a background color. Set whether the background \n"
"image should come above or behind the color. Line art \n"
"PDFs with a tranpsarent background may display better\n"
"above the color layer, as the color layer will not then \n"
"wash them out, but .JPGs are probably better behind,\n"
"as .JPG images do not have transparency."
msgstr "只有在同时存在背景图像\n"
"和背景颜色的情况下才相关。设置背景 \n"
"图像在背景颜色的前面或后面。具有透明背景的线描艺术 \n"
"PDF可能在颜色层上方的显色度更好，\n"
"因为颜色层不会 \n"
"将它们洗掉，但.JPG格式的图像可能在后面更好，\n"
"因为.JPG图像没有透明度。"

#: temp.glade:12653
msgid "Layer\n"
"Order:"
msgstr "层\n"
"顺序："

#: temp.glade:12667
msgid "Only relevant where there is both a background image\n"
"*and* a background color. Set whether the background \n"
"image should come above or behind the color. Line art \n"
"PDFs with a transparent background may display better\n"
"above the color layer, as the color layer will not then \n"
"wash them out, but .JPGs are probably better behind,\n"
"as .JPG images do not have transparency."
msgstr "仅当同时存在背景图像\n"
"和背景颜色时才有意义。设置背景\n"
"图像位于颜色的上方还是后方。具有透明背景的线描\n"
"PDF放在颜色层上方可能显示效果更好，\n"
"因为颜色层不会\n"
"使其变淡，而.JPG图像\n"
"没有透明度，放在后方可能更好。"

